IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. XHS-PROCESSSOR.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
...
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-RAW-DATA       PIC X(100).
01  WS-STATUS         PIC X(10).
01  WS-COUNTER        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- STARTING XHS BATCH PROCESS ---".
    
    * Simulation de lecture de stream provenant du MCP
    MOVE "TITLE:PROD1;PRICE:10" TO WS-RAW-DATA.
    PERFORM PROCESS-RECORD.
    
    MOVE "TITLE:PROD2;PRICE:20" TO WS-RAW-DATA.
    PERFORM PROCESS-RECORD.

    DISPLAY "--- TOTAL RECORDS PROCESSED: " WS-COUNTER " ---".
    STOP RUN.

PROCESS-RECORD.
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER.
    IF WS-RAW-DATA(1:5) = 'TITLE' THEN
        DISPLAY "RECORD VALID: " WS-RAW-DATA
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "RECORD INVALID: " WS-RAW-DATA
    END-IF.
.